WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
But I can give you a bowl of hot water

2
00:00:02,160 --> 00:00:03,760
You can leave after drinking

3
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:05,730
What Mou Chuan

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,770
You, you are so heartless

5
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:11,150
Don't take yourself too seriously. Since you took that faint

6
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:13,630
From the moment we fell into the snow, between you and me

7
00:00:13,790 --> 00:00:15,070
There is no relationship anymore

8
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:20,180
What are you

9
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:23,460
He's just a poor loser with a broken family. You think I care about you?

10
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:25,340
Stay in this dirty, smelly mud pit of yours?

11
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,910
A rat like you is hiding underground

12
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:30,950
I'll just struggle in the mud for the rest of my life, I tell you.

13
00:00:30,950 --> 00:00:32,830
Wait until I get back to the city, back to He's house

14
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,350
Still eating and drinking spicy food every day

15
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:35,820
Kneel down and beg me

16
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,460
Even if you kneel down and beg me then

17
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,860
I won’t even give you a centimeter of charity

18
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,260
How come you, a woman, don’t know what’s good or bad?

19
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,780
It was Brother Mouchuan who ran you out of the snow and saved your life.

20
00:00:42,780 --> 00:00:45,260
You didn't even say thank you and you dared to stone me

21
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:47,180
The road is just over the doorway

22
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,180
Climb out and walk down the mountain
